  "problem_statement": "The IEEE 802.15.4 frame header length parser must treat a data frame as malformed, returning 0, when neither a destination nor a source address is present. Today `ieee802154_get_frame_hdr_len()` returns the base header length for such a frame instead of rejecting it.",
